c.html","DesktopActivityServer.dc.html","ActivityEmpty.dc.html","ActivityDeviceEmpty.dc.html","ActivityServerEmpty.dc.html","ActivityOffline.dc.html","ActivityDeviceOffline.dc.html","ActivityServerOffline.dc.html","ActivityMember.dc.html","ActivityDeviceMember.dc.html","ActivityFailedSave.dc.html","ActivityServerPaused.dc.html","WorkerNotInUse.dc.html","DesktopActivityDevice.dc.html","BookSeries.dc.html","Series.dc.html","SeriesAdd.dc.html","LibrarySeries.dc.html","DesktopSeries.dc.html","Reader.dc.html","ReaderControls.dc.html","ReaderSpeed.dc.html","ReaderScroll.dc.html","ReaderAppearance.dc.html","ReaderWrapA.dc.html","ReaderWrapB.dc.html","Chapters.dc.html","DesktopReader.dc.html"],"notes":{"phone":{"x":0,"y":1080,"text":"Phone","kind":"title1","maxW":2270},"desktop":{"x":0,"y":2264,"text":"Desktop","kind":"title1","maxW":2640},"files":{"x":0,"y":3404,"text":"A book and its files","kind":"title1","maxW":2740},"sync":{"x":0,"y":4588,"text":"Reading sync","kind":"title1","maxW":1330},"activity":{"x":0,"y":5772,"text":"Activity","kind":"title1","maxW":4520},"series":{"x":0,"y":6992,"text":"Series","kind":"title1","maxW":3160},"reading":{"x":0,"y":8272,"text":"Listening and reading","kind":"title1","maxW":5040},"filesNew":{"x":2820,"y":3664,"w":340,"text":"New behaviour on these boards: Keep on this device is one switch for the whole book (audiobook, ebook and the reading sync map), and a book with only an ebook sits in the Library. The Book page goes on below the files: the description, Hardcover, Mark as finished and Remove (Book: further down). The rest gives a new home to what the app does today."},"syncSteps":{"x":1410,"y":4848,"w":340,"text":"The steps are those of the whole-book job that production runs. The chapter matcher of the older engine is not drawn."},"activityPlace":{"x":4600,"y":6032,"w":340,"text":"Activity is a fourth place. It takes over the Downloads page, Settings, Activity and Settings, Reading sync. The phone Server board shows the top of a longer list; the desktop board shows all of it."},"seriesPage":{"x":3240,"y":7252,"w":340,"text":"A series is a page, not a dialog. Its books are listed in reading order with the row used everywhere else, and each one opens its book. A book says which series it belongs to under its author. Add and the two Get switches are today’s Add selected works and its two search options."},"readingRules":{"x":5120,"y":8532,"w":340,"text":"Now playing (in the first row) has two faces, Listen and Read, with the same transport. The Lyrics and Word views are gone; Reading mode (Pages or Scroll) is the first row of Appearance. Speed and the sleep timer take the place of the transport in the foot (Reader: speed). Controls only appear in the head and the foot of the page, which keep their height, so the text does not move and is never covered. The two boards \"across pages\" show one sentence before and after the page turns. The rules are on the Reading board at the top."},"tooltipMarks":{"x":5440,"y":0,"w":340,"text":"An info mark opens its tooltip on a tap in Play mode. Three are drawn open: on Book, on Worker and on the desktop Server board. Every text is listed on the Tooltips board."},"activityStates":{"x":11550,"y":6032,"w":340,"text":"The states of Activity that were not drawn before (#458): empty, no connection, someone who is not the administrator, a failed save on this device, a queue that is Paused and a worker that is Not in use, and This device on the desktop. Paused and Not in use do not light the attention dot; a failed save on this device does, for anyone."},"bookStates":{"x":5590,"y":3664,"w":340,"text":"The Book page states that were not drawn before (#460): the Hardcover page behind the Hardcover row (shelf, lists, the match, the Hardcover edition, Use Hardcover position), the same page before a match, a book that is not in the library yet with Add to library, a book with nothing yet, and a book with only a PDF (Read off, the PDF opens in another app). Where a book has no audiobook and none is on its way, its Get is the main action."}},"designSystems":[]}